Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.97,Signs_Chat,Sign,700,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「呜哇 看起来好冷—www」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:37.31,Signs_Chat,Sign,550,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「都是没装备的外行」
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:39.68,Signs_Chat,Sign,900,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「灵子和神奈都加油啊—！！」
