Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.41,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)}「性格好差」
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.24,0:15:35.83,Signs_Chat,Sign,850,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「清司郎老师是不会输的」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:38.42,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,150,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「真残酷啊」
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.33,Signs_Chat,Sign,400,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}「无法原谅！」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:02.37,Signs_Chat,Sign,90,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「爸爸是很强的」
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.13,0:19:12.30,Signs_Chat,Sign,90,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}「爸爸是很强的」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:16.59,Signs_Chat,Sign,350,0,0,,{\fad(300,1)}「怎么回事？」
